@startuml 13-runtime-control-loop
!pragma layout smetana
' 运行时控制闭环：状态所有权、pump 防重入、输入等待和帧确认。
' 来源：GameProc/system_state_machine.h, process_state.h, script_runner.h,
'       execution_engine.h, GameView/console_backend.h, qml/Console.qml

title 运行时控制闭环：状态所有权与恢复时序

participant "SystemStateMachine\n(pump / handler owner)" as SSM
participant "ProcessState\n(state owner)" as PS
participant "ScriptRunner\n(call-stack owner)" as SR
participant "VariableStorage\n(named array slots)" as VS
participant "ExecutionEngine\n(instruction semantics)" as EE
participant "ConsoleBackend" as CB
participant "QML Console" as QML
participant "PresentationFallback" as Fallback
participant "Injected TimerFn" as Timer

note over SSM,EE
  状态所有权：ProcessState 持有 SystemStateCode、ExecState 和 currentMin；
  SystemStateMachine 负责状态处理器调度与 pump 门控；
  ScriptRunner 维护调用栈；ExecutionEngine 只执行指令语义和发出输出/输入信号。
end note

SSM -> SSM : pump() enters with m_pumpActive=false
SSM -> SSM : m_pumpActive=true
SSM -> SR : runSlice()
SR -> EE : executeInstruction(line, scope)
EE --> SR : instruction result / output signals
SR -> VS : named 1D array element read/write
VS --> SR : real system or user slot
SR -> PS : read or set ExecState
PS --> SSM : execStateChanged(state)

alt Continue and script reaches frame floor
  SR --> SSM : suspended(Continue), atSystemFloor=true
  SSM -> SSM : runSystemProc(SystemStateCode)
  SSM -> PS : state transition / setSystemState
else ordinary input
  SR --> SSM : suspended(WaitInput)
  SSM -> CB : inputKindRequested(kind, default)
  CB --> QML : waitingInput / inputKind
else system input
  SSM -> PS : requestWaitSystemInput()
  SSM -> CB : inputKindRequested(kind, default)
  CB --> QML : system input surface
end

note over SSM
  防重入：pump() 若 m_pumpActive=true，则置 m_pumpScheduled=true，
  不递归进入；当前 pump 退出后再消费已调度的 continuation。
end note
SSM -> SSM : m_pumpActive=false; if m_pumpScheduled, queue continuation

== timed wait and frame acknowledgement ==
SSM -> PS : set ExecState::WaitInput
SSM -> CB : request presentation / arm pending TimedWait
CB -> Fallback : start 50ms presentation fallback
CB -> QML : presentationRequested(generation)
QML -> QML : Qt.callLater(syncView, positionStage)
QML -> CB : notifyFramePresented(generation)
CB -> CB : ignore stale or duplicate generation
CB -> Fallback : stop fallback
CB -> SSM : framePresented / onFramePresented()
SSM -> Timer : start(timeout)
Timer --> SSM : timeout callback
SSM -> PS : write default value; requestResume()
PS -> SSM : continueExecution()
SSM -> SSM : pump() (after prior pump returned)

alt input arrives first
  QML -> CB : submitInput(value)
  CB -> SSM : resume(value) / resumeString(value)
  SSM -> Timer : cancel pending timed wait
  SSM -> SSM : pump()
else no QML acknowledgement before deadline
  Fallback --> CB : timeout -> notifyFramePresented()
  CB -> SSM : framePresented / onFramePresented()
  SSM -> Timer : start(timeout) after fallback
  Timer --> SSM : immediate or timed callback
  SSM -> SSM : pump()
end

legend bottom
  WaitInput = ordinary script input; WaitSystemInput = SystemStateMachine flow input.
  TimedWait is a pending wait, not a new ExecState; its timer starts only after
  the QML model/stage acknowledgement. notifyFramePresented does not mean pixels
  were swapped or displayed. Frame acknowledgement is therefore a pacing gate.
endlegend
@enduml
